{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/e2d0c905373df4e5280bc246202fbe23.avif?t=1757502003\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fantasy <i>Puzzle-Platformer</i> for <i>Co-op</i> Lovers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the spellbinding world of <i>Weeny Wise</i>, where cooperation and exploration are essential to survival! Take on the role of two brave adventurers, Anneli and Hugo, as they explore a vast, magical world filled with hidden secrets, an original lore, and a variety of puzzles and platforming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins as the dark sorcerer Ragna returns after years, wielding a powerful talisman to rally the Weeny Wise in a war that could endanger the entire human race or Weeny Wise. But yet, there\u2019s a glimmer of hope with Anneli and Hugo, young students at a magical school who survived Ragna\u2019s initial attack. Together, they embark on a quest to find the Four Seals of imprisoned magic, a path that may be their last chance to end Ragna's plans and save both Weeny Wise and humans from war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/86612520b04ba4058b0157550085894d.poster.avif?t=1757502003\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/86612520b04ba4058b0157550085894d.webm?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/86612520b04ba4058b0157550085894d.mp4?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/0303260cb103955032b34978aa7e3495.avif?t=1757502003\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>co-op</strong> game, Weeny Wise is played with two main characters. You must, with the help of a friend, navigate through the storyline and game levels. <strong>Single-player advancement in the game is not feasible!</strong> (It is currently planned that all copies purchased will come with an additional copy you can gift to a friend, at <strong>no extra charge!</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/fe2f8c5755440e24feb6c96fba1f1908.poster.avif?t=1757502003\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/fe2f8c5755440e24feb6c96fba1f1908.webm?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/fe2f8c5755440e24feb6c96fba1f1908.mp4?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/8c2a935001fb70253f826d9db33a8afb.avif?t=1757502003\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the world of Weeny Wise you will encounter various magical stones. These stones will give you different abilities needed to both advance in the game, and be a good companion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/66bbd71c4500ebb24bf44e490be96e90.poster.avif?t=1757502003\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/66bbd71c4500ebb24bf44e490be96e90.webm?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/66bbd71c4500ebb24bf44e490be96e90.mp4?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/48517c219bfaf38b8c995aa1c070108e.avif?t=1757502003\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter the world of <i>Weeny Wise</i>, you will have the opportunity to fully explore the <strong>Sentinels' Realm</strong> and parts of the <strong>Initials</strong> and <strong>Icicles</strong> realms. Use your abilities to uncover hidden items, information, and events as you progress through these magical lands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/759f26f5acf067a70e5526e7140342a3.poster.avif?t=1757502003\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/759f26f5acf067a70e5526e7140342a3.webm?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/759f26f5acf067a70e5526e7140342a3.mp4?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/6d124cd72b5747e57a60acc297655736.avif?t=1757502003\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regna has enchanted some creatures to protect her position and you have to hide, escape, or even fight them with the help of your companion and  magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/10a224f3294d22cc5b370d6f5d96519c.poster.avif?t=1757502003\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/10a224f3294d22cc5b370d6f5d96519c.webm?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/10a224f3294d22cc5b370d6f5d96519c.mp4?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/0d170f46fe5d2ca3446c2c4d6f28485e.avif?t=1757502003\" width=613 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can team up with your companion in a dedicated section to experience exciting and diverse mini-games, competing together or against other teams.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/3c0645ac7febf1fe9b066083f6e09a3b.poster.avif?t=1757502003\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/3c0645ac7febf1fe9b066083f6e09a3b.webm?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820270/extras/3c0645ac7febf1fe9b066083f6e09a3b.mp4?t=1757502003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820270?t=1757502003","backgrou